          "Document 7's historian synthesis directly supports the thesis's key complexity point: immediate failure by 1898 should be distinguished from lasting legacy, since several specific demands from both movements (Populist constitutional amendments, labor's basic organizing model) would achieve greater success during the subsequent Progressive Era — a strong essay should make this distinction explicit as its central complexity argument.",
